WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.780
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:07.920
Keep it down.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.410
You're disturbing my rest.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:14.300
Th-There's an e-egg in my bed!

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.640
What?!

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:18.100
Wh-What happened, Amu-chan?

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.660
That's what I want to know!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.470
Isn't it one of your friends?

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:23.930
I-I have no idea.

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:26.660
But it looks just like our eggs.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.520
It really does.

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.270
It's warm.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:41.020
A fourth Guardian Egg?

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:46.350
The Fourth Guardian Egg!

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:46.350
Episode 27

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.780
Spring.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.450
Kukai graduated.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.130
Nadeshiko is studying abroad.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.160
And as for my family...

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:56.470
Plum Class, Hinamori Ami-chan!

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:57.680
Yesh!

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:00.010
That's great, Ami-chan!

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:00.810
You mean, "yes," Ami-chan.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:00.820
Looking adorable!

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:01.210
Yes!

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.710
Wonderful!

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.540
Yes, that's more like it!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.240
Is this supposed to be...

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.890
We're rehearsing for Ami-chan's kindergarten entrance ceremony, of course.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.270
So she isn't nervous during the real thing.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.600
Yesh!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:16.680
And your daddy will risk his life to record this memory with steady hands!

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.610
You look cute, Ami-chan.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.800
Plum Class, Hinamori Ami-chan!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.560
Yes!

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.890
Good job!

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:24.560
Ami.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:25.590
Huh?

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.140
Congrats on entering kindergarten.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.100
Yes!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.340
I'm the heart!

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:37.970
I'm the spade!

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.850
I'm the clover!

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:41.600
Which means this one's the diamond.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.000
It's like a complete set.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.200
I wonder if she'll come out soon.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.970
I can't wait!

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:49.550
Right, Amu-chan?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:53.490
It makes my head hurt to think about another noisy one popping out.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:54.790
I knew she'd say that!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.900
Stubborn character remains intact.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.290
A new Guardian Character.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:08.890
I wonder what she'll be like.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:12.130
Shouldn't we report this to the other Guardians?

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:13.000
Nope.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.160
I'm going to keep it a secret until it hatches.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.580
Ah, Amu-chan!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:17.800
That's dangerous!

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.540
You mustn't drop the egg!

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.600
A new semester.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.590
Starting today, I'm a sixth-grader!

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:27.570
I get the feeling we're going to have lots of fun.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.640
Kiss the starry sky;

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:39.300
the time has come for good children to sleep.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:48.170
Don't stare at me, don't capture me.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:55.020
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.350
Go, Utau!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:05:01.770
I sing of freedom on invisible wings;

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:08.700
I've hidden them deep inside your heart.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:12.720
Here they come! Here they come!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.600
Utau, take more eggs!

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.470
You shouldn't!

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:21.240
Such an act

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.220
is wrong!

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:25.400
Zip it!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.610
Make yourself scarce, El!

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.320
I won't!

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.560
I'll stop both you and Utau-chan!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.730
Everybody came to listen to Utau-chan sing.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.060
How can you take their hearts' eggs?

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.390
It's absolutely wrong!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.520
Good job, Utau!

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.650
I'll need you to maintain this pace.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:48.770
I know.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:51.130
You mustn't accept it!

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.350
If you repent at once-

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.350
Shut up!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.660
Utau doesn't need you!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.570
She doesn't even Character Transform with you.

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.140
Utau-chan.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.150
Utau-chan.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.140
Utau-chan!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.790
I'm going rogue!

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.080
And don't bother coming back!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.560
I won't lose to you,

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.560
Hinamori Amu.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:36.220
Uh, which class am I in?

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.250
Good morning, Hinamori-san.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.640
Tadase-kun.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.770
We're in the same class this year.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:43.870
Let's have fun.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:45.200
Star class

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:46.540
Hotori Tadase

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.540
Hinamori Amu

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.600
For real?!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.450
Well, there are only two classes.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.030
We were bound to end up together eventually.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:01.490
Here comes the stubborn character again.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.080
6th Grade: Star Class

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.000
A new class still makes me nervous.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:18.920
Look, look!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:19.930
It's the Joker!

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.710
Wow! So cool!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.850
{they're still going on in background about jokers}

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:24.850
My outside character's still intact here.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.380
I'm happy to be in the same class as Tadase-kun,

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.620
but I want some girl friends.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:33.640
Hinamori-san,

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.810
we're in the same class again.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:40.640
I, Yamabuki Saya, will become your friend if you so desire.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:44.000
Hinamori-san, were you listening?

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:44.680
Yay!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:45.810
It's Amu-chan!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.650
Manami-chan. Wakana-chan.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.260
E-Excuse me.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:51.100
I guess we're in the same class again.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.440
Guess what, Amu-chan?

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.440
Um, excuse me.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:56.330
Wakana and I have been in the same class for six years now.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.740
Hinamori-san?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.770
Um...

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.920
Like a friend you can't get rid of?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.930
You know...

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.880
Yeah? Must be nice.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.140
It isn't.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.220
I'm sick of it.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:02.770
Hey!

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:03.990
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:05.980
'Cause it defeats the purpose of changing classes.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:07.010
If only Nadeshiko were here.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.560
You know you're happy about it.

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:08.400
No way!

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:08.400
What's the point?

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.760
I can't be depressed because Nadeshiko's gone.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.390
I have to do my best to smile and make friends!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.430
Terrifying!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:19.490
A-Amu-chan?

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:21.180
It's not like I care about you or anything, anyway, Hinamori-san.

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:21.180
Wh-What's wrong?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.120
Huh?

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.150
What do you mean?

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.550
Amu-chan's scary!

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.180
Way too scary!

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.850
It's having the opposite effect.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.310
Everyone, listen up!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.220
Big news! Big news!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.910
We're getting a transfer student!

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:40.390
Transfer student?!

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.220
A transfer student, he said!

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:43.420
Awesome!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.830
Hey, you serious?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.000
Is it a boy? A girl?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:46.740
A girl.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:48.060
And she's super-

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:48.510
Hey, hey.

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:51.180
Maybe she'll be the new Queen's Chair?

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:51.730
Huh?

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.490
After all, Soma-sama graduated,

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.310
and Nadeshiko-sama is studying abroad, right?

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.700
The Guardians will be getting new members!

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:00.130
Is that true, Tadase-kun?

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.080
A new Queen...

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.340
Man!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:09.310
I wanna know about that, too, but listen to this!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:12.520
Because she's super duper-

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.750
That's enough talking.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:17.100
It's time to take your seat.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:19.040
He's our homeroom teacher?

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.410
Well then...

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:28.430
Man, it looks like everybody's already waiting.

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.640
I suppose I don't have a choice.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.480
In that case, I'll introduce the transfer student.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.680
Okay, come in!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.060
Meet our transfer student, Mashiro Rima-san.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:17.600
Meet our transfer student, Mashiro Rima-san.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.970
Super cute!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.230
Wh-What's with this girl?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.060
She's incredibly cute!

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.240
Her eyes are like a fawn's!

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.650
She's all small and cuddly!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.470
She's sweet like candy!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:38.520
Inner voice of the entire class

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.520
The perfect girl.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.730
Do you two feel that?

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:41.370
Uh-huh.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:42.270
What?

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.350
What's wrong?

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.760
We can sense a Guardian Character with her.

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:47.220
Huh?

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:49.210
All right, Mashiro-san.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.970
Please introduce yourself to everyone with a smile!

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.510
Sensei, excuse me.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.930
Awesome, she spoke!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.950
Yes, what is it?

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.720
I can't smile when nothing funny has happened.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:15.720
Dumbfounded

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:15.140
Sensei.

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:15.720
Yes?

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.870
Is my seat over there?

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.220
Uh, yeah.

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:34.340
H-Have a seat.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.060
Thank you.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.410
Swoon

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.450
Wh-What's with that?

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:47.490
Gloom

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.930
Isn't that disgusting?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.490
But she totally screams popular.

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:54.870
Maybe she's the type that hides behind an outside character, too.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.260
She's probably frozen stiff inside.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:58.440
So cool!

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:59.450
First Day after Transferring

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:59.430
since this <i>is</i> her first day after transferring.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:00.680
Okay.

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:03.430
This doesn't fit my character, but I'll try just once.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.440
H-Hi.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:08.300
I'm Hinamori Amu.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.680
N-Nice to meet you!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.160
Face muscles in trouble! Stiffening up!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.780
Keep at it, Amu-chan!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.040
I transferred here last year.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.180
Doesn't it suck how you have to introduce yourself right off the bat?

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:23.700
Silence

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.630
U-Um...

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.050
Don't give in, Amu-chan!

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.680
One more push!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:27.250
If you'd like, I could show you around the school.

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.390
What are you smiling about?

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.350
Nothing funny happened.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.330
How stupid.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.950
How stupid

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:35.670
Don't bother me with meaningless chatter.

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:37.670
Hey now!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:38.960
Don't you think your attitude's a little much?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:40.220
You're not going to make any friends like that.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:40.220
Hold on.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.190
I'm not particularly interested.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:45.140
Even if I have no friends...

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:45.080
Wink

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:49.140
Here's a wet towel!

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:52.230
All I need are servants.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.990
Despicable!

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.310
This is the problem with boys!

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:55.990
Tadase-kun would never be like this!

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:57.720
I've never encountered her type before.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:58.950
What?

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:00.770
Unforgivable!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.770
Just awful!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:03.230
We're on your side, Amu-chan!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.270
Totally in the Hinamori-san faction!

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:04.810
Faction?

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:07.490
We shall follow Rima-sama!

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.770
Wherever I go, boys like to flock.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.240
Boys vs Girls

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:17.060
Wh-What is this?

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.890
We've got an unbelievable new character here!

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.660
H-Hey, everyone, calm down!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.730
Mashiro-san just transferred in so she's probably-

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.380
Amu-chan!

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:27.300
Are you okay?

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:29.430
Doesn't look like it.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.200
It's finally over.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.720
Hinamori-san.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.580
Tadase-kun.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.500
There was quite the commotion today,

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.980
but it looks like we'll have a fun year.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.910
Y-You think so?

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:47.470
Ah.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.640
I've never encountered her type before.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.330
Is something wrong?

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.890
Oh, it's nothing.

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:02.520
So heavy.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.240
Running away from home is so hard.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.690
But I'm never going back to Utau-chan and Il.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:16.510
I'm such a poor little girl.

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.190
Poor little El.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.210
She's all by herself.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.540
It still hasn't hatched?

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:27.720
Please come out soon.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.990
There are many fun things outside.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.930
Hey, maybe that girl's the new Queen.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.260
Probably.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:39.650
I think she'd make an incredible Queen.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:41.850
Are you a little worried?

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.580
Huh?

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:43.720
Not at all.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.000
Yeah.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.640
It doesn't matter who it is.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:50.790
Kukai and Nadeshiko are already gone.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:52.630
It's a little out of character,

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.710
but I have to be strong.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.470
Amu-chan, look there.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:59.140
Yaya?

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.430
Yaya, whatcha doing?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.060
An X Egg?

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:07.110
Jeez.

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:10.190
I was about to catch it!

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:11.280
Sorry.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.080
Pepe-chan!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.190
Character Change!

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.220
Okay-dechu!

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:18.600
Pretty Cutie Love Baby!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.170
Amu-chi,

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.170
don't interfere this time!

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:25.090
B-But can you handle it by yourself?

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.100
Of course!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:31.990
Gigantic Rattle Ultra-Spinning Super Attack!

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:35.310
Everything's spinning.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.310
What was that?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:38.220
If we just stand around, the X Egg will get away.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.940
Ran, let's Character Transform.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:43.190
Huh? But Yaya said not to interfere.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.390
Just hurry up!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.520
Okay!

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.390
My heart:

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:50.810
Unlock!

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:06.420
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.600
You're still a secret from everyone.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:14.830
Let's cheer Amu-chan on from here so we're not discovered.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.890
Heart Rod!

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:20.520
Spiral Heart!

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:22.580
Huh?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:23.990
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:25.730
You're using too much power!

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.510
Amu-chan, hang in there!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.600
Keep at it!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.220
Jeez!

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:34.520
Amu-chi?

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:35.380
What?

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:41.040
Sheesh, Amu-chi!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.230
That's dangerous.

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.830
We'll take the Heart Rod away from you-dechu!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.830
That was about to hit me!

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:45.540
Sorry!

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:50.040
Ah, the X Egg is running away!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:50.980
Amu-chan!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.270
Y-Yeah.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:56.980
Hinamori-san,

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:57.930
now's your chance!

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.680
O-Okay.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:02.930
Negative Heart:

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:05.810
Lock On!

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:13.140
Open Heart!

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.470
It's okay, Amu-chan.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.280
Hinamori-san, Yuiki-san!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.470
Are you all right?

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:43.910
What's wrong, Amu-chi?

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.750
Oh, sorry about earlier.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:49.260
That was totally no problem!

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:51.210
Are you all right, though?

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.990
You weren't your usual self.

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.040
Y-You think so?

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.930
Where's the diamond Guardian Egg?

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:01.770
It's resting inside her bag.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:04.450
I'm pretty tired.

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:07.010
All that useless running around left me pretty down.

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:09.680
Usually, at a time like this...

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.390
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.270
If there's something on your mind, you can talk to me about it.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.190
What's got you down?

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.930
That's not like you, Hinamori.

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:19.770
Hey, Tadase.

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:22.970
Who are the new Jack and Queen going to be?

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.980
Tell me! Tell me!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:27.980
You'll have to wait for the tea party at the Royal Garden.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:29.390
Meanie!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:32.140
Why can't you tell me now?

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.750
The wait is part of the fun.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.710
I don't know what that means.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:41.530
Hinamori-san?

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:44.260
I-I think I left something in the classroom.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.270
Go on without me.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.300
Rima!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.480
How do you like your new school?

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:01.050
It's normal.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:04.970
Did you see the girl next to you?

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.850
She had three Guardian Characters!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.550
Stop rambling on like a fool.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:13.840
If someone were watching, they'd think I was talking to myself.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.060
Was she crying?

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:30.210
I didn't actually leave anything behind.

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:31.930
What am I doing?

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:34.430
Okay, let's announce the results!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.180
Well, I can already guess how it's gonna turn out.

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:41.270
The girls in our class aren't that great, with a few exceptions.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.180
Ta-da!

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.890
The 6th Grade Star Class Cute Girl Ranking!

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:48.140
Huh? Ranking?

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:49.090
What is this?

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:50.640
Those guys are disgusting!

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:53.160
And in first place, we have...

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.270
Our new transfer student, the lovely Mashiro Rima!

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.720
She's brutal, but that's part of her charm.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:01.200
And you've gotta love the contrast with her appearance.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.430
Hey, what about Hinamori Amu?

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:05.850
Well, she ended up being surprisingly ordinary.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.280
She's getting along with all the other girls.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:08.140
Yeah, yeah.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.310
The whole lone wolf thing was a lot cooler, but somehow

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.040
she isn't like herself anymore.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.560
Huh?

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.390
A-Amu-chan!

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:24.030
Wh-What was that?

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:27.560
I'm pooped.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:31.430
I must find a place to sleep before it gets dark.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.360
I'm starving.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.080
I skipped the tea party.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.060
Amu-chan.

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.700
Whatever.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.660
It's not that I care or anything, really.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:52.510
I don't particularly want to be popular or universally loved.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:57.060
It's just that, I worked hard so people wouldn't only see my outside character.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.790
N-Nice to meet you!

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:03.930
I tried my best to smile.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.180
And yet...

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.210
They say I'm stupid,

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:08.470
or not like myself.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.730
It's spring.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.690
It's a new beginning.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:18.270
I worked hard to force myself to act differently.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.060
Jeez, Amu-chi!

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:21.120
That's dangerous!

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:24.270
You weren't your usual self.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:26.770
I...

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.640
I've had it!

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.220
What am I supposed to do?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:32.600
I don't get it!

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.350
Nothing good happens in spring!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:40.130
Who am I, really?

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.680
How do I act like myself?

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.390
Amu-chan, the egg!

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:49.220
Huh?

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:10.760
My...

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:12.970
My egg...

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:17.600
Has been marked with an X?

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:49.190
I'm number one today! Yay!

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:53.120
Mashiro Rima-san transferred into our class.

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:54.270
She's all cuddly.

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:55.810
And super cute!

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:57.240
A big hit with the boys, too.

00:23:57.240 --> 00:24:00.210
But she just transferred here, so she's probably nervous.

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:01.030
Okay.

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:03.470
I'll work hard to become her friend!

00:24:03.880 --> 00:24:05.150
H-Hello.

00:24:05.150 --> 00:24:07.710
Why are you smiling when nothing funny happened?

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:09.340
Burned.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:10.950
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:10.950 --> 00:24:13.390
Failure as the Joker? New Guardians Arrive!

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:15.200
Huh? I'm a failure?

00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:16.470
Yes, a failure.

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:17.740
Burned!

00:24:17.740 --> 00:24:20.060
Amu-chan, hang in there!
